00:50:42.000 --> 00:50:44.000
Sama tehing.

00:50:44.000 --> 00:50:47.000
Me hoiame eemale,
et teda mitte hirmutada.

00:50:47.000 --> 00:50:51.000
Härrased, kui te paikama hakkate,

00:50:52.000 --> 00:50:54.000
